IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x S= NOT;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED a negated empty slot outside a lone coil value

#### measure-negated-empty-branch — a negated empty slot elsewhere is not measured
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := s BRANCH (NOT, b);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED a negated empty slot outside a lone coil value

#### measure-edge-en — an edge on the EN pin is not measured
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  MOVE 1 => x ENO R_EDGE EN c;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED an edge on the EN pin

#### measure-terminator-fed-parallel — `NOT BRANCH (…)` is not measured
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := NOT BRANCH (a, b);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED a Parallel fed by the empty terminator

#### measure-move-two-inputs — MOVE with 0 or 2 inputs is not measured
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION FBD
NETWORK
  `MOVE`(a, b, => x);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED a MOVE with no input or two

