NETWORK
  x := `MOVE`();
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED a MOVE with no input or two

#### measure-negated-output-pin — a modified output pin is not measured
=== scope
instance c1 CTU
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  c1 : CTU(CU := a, NOT CV => n);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
