NETWORK
  x := NOT (EXECUTE
i := 1;
            END_EXECUTE ENO EN go);
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED a flag on an Execute box

#### measure-rising-and-falling — one edge per node
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := R_EDGE F_EDGE a;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_BAD_EXPRESSION a modifier after a modifier

#### unsupported-beside-items — the UNSUPPORTED line is its network's only line
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  x := a;
  UNSUPPORTED "a flag on a box input pin" #3f9a01c2;
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_UNSUPPORTED is its network's only line

#### unsupported-without-hash — the UNSUPPORTED line carries the network's hash
=== text
IMPLEMENTATION LD
NETWORK
  UNSUPPORTED "a flag on a box input pin";
END_NETWORK
=== refused
NETWORK_PARSE ends with the network's hash
